systerm (0.1.4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix broadcast amplification: feeding the other panes made them re-emit
    "commit" asynchronously, so one keystroke fanned out again and again,
    filling every pane with hundreds of copies of each character. Only the
    focused pane's input now fans out, so the fed panes' echoes are ignored.

 -- Sysible <sysiblesoftware@gmail.com>  Thu, 06 Aug 2026 18:54:49 +0000

systerm (0.1.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix crash when broadcasting to all panes (feeding each pane re-emitted
    "commit", recursing until the stack overflowed); guard against re-entry.
  * Palette: bright-green slot also set to the logo green so bold prompts match.
  * Package: colour root's shell prompt royal blue on install (marked block in
    /root/.bashrc, removed on uninstall) so root reads on-brand like users.

 -- Sysible <sysiblesoftware@gmail.com>  Thu, 06 Aug 2026 17:02:23 +0000

